          <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"person","folderId":"Dmitri Kowalczyk","fieldKey":"description"} -->
          <Description>Dmitri Kowalczyk belongs to Frameless Expressionism and works in Studio 4, the old soap factory. Asked about influences, Dmitri Kowalczyk said only "the shadow of a canvas that was never painted".</Description>
